Q: How Can I Resolve the &quot;Couldn&#39;t resolve parser &#39;angular&#39;&quot; Error When Using Prettier in StackBlitz? A: <p>This took some fussing to get the interpolated code to format, which requires estree. Here's a complete, working example. Note the prettier version bump.</p>
<p>package.json:</p>
<pre class="lang-json prettyprint-override"><code>{
  &quot;dependencies&quot;: {
    &quot;prettier&quot;: &quot;^3.9.0&quot;
  }
}
</code></pre>
<p>Code:</p>
<pre class="lang-ts prettyprint-override"><code>import * as prettier from &quot;prettier/standalone&quot;;
import * as htmlPlugin from &quot;prettier/plugins/html&quot;;
import * as angularPlugin from &quot;prettier/plugins/angular&quot;;
import * as estreePlugin from &quot;prettier/plugins/estree&quot;;

const html = `
&lt;span *ngIf=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
  do {{ some    |    json: ja }} bla
&lt;/span&gt;`;

(async () =&gt; {
  const output = await prettier.format(html, {
    parser: &quot;angular&quot;,
    plugins: [htmlPlugin, angularPlugin, estreePlugin],
  });
  console.log(output);
  const appDiv: HTMLElement = document.getElementById(&quot;app&quot;);
  appDiv.innerHTML = output;
})();
</code></pre>
<p>CDN version, for completeness:</p>
<p><div class="snippet" data-lang="js" data-hide="false" data-console="true" data-babel="false" data-babel-preset-react="false" data-babel-preset-ts="false">
<div class="snippet-code">
<pre class="snippet-code-js lang-js prettyprint-override"><code>const html = `
&lt;span *ngIf="true"&gt;
  do {{ some    |    json: ja }} bla
&lt;/span&gt;`;

(async () =&gt; {
  const output = await prettier.format(html, {
    parser: "angular",
    plugins: prettierPlugins,
  });
  document.getElementById("output").textContent = output;
  console.log(output);
})();</code></pre>
<pre class="snippet-code-html lang-html prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/prettier@3.9.0/standalone.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/prettier@3.9.0/plugins/html.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/prettier@3.9.0/plugins/angular.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/prettier@3.9.0/plugins/estree.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;pre id="output"&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</p>

Q: Issue with case statement inside stored procedure A: <ol>
<li>You are missing a semi-colon after <code>END</code></li>
<li>You need to use a delimiter other than <code>;</code> in order to create procedure</li>
</ol>

<p>See <a href="https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/5.7/en/stored-programs-defining.html" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Defining Stored Programs</a> for explanation.</p>

<pre class="lang-sql prettyprint-override"><code>DELIMITER foo

CREATE PROCEDURE p(IN code VARCHAR(200))
BEGIN
  CASE code
    WHEN 'first_company' THEN INSERT INTO dest_first SELECT code, * FROM srctable;
    ELSE                      INSERT INTO dest_other SELECT '1',  * FROM srctable;
  END CASE;
END;
foo

DELIMITER ;

SET @company_code = 0;
SELECT @company_code := LOWER(value) FROM settings WHERE setting_name = 'COMPANY_CODE';
CALL p(@company_code);
</code></pre>
